<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.vessel.stops ~ the daemon halts on its port; a free port reads stopped

`lares vessel stop` ends the daemon on the port (LAR_PORT): SIGTERM, then waits on its own exit, reporting past the grace who still holds it. `cut=true` delivers the operator's one further signal past that grace. A free port reads as stopped.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ stop · cut

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`stop` params=`~ halt the daemon`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`cut` params=`cut/true ~ cut a hung teardown`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

